<title>SINGAPORE: TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SINGAPORE OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the</p>
<p>men's Singapore Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Javier Frana (Argentina) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat 2-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>5-7 7-6 (7-3) retired</p>
</text>
